        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "FLASH SALE Get 10% OFF everything using the coupon code: FLASH10 View Pricing Plans &rarr;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Themes Featured Theme Inspiro Premium The #1 theme for video &amp; photo websites 45+ Starter sites, fullscreen video backgrounds, photo galleries, and advanced customization options."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Popular Themes Foodica PRO The best theme for food bloggers &amp; recipe sites. Reel Video portfolio theme for creatives &amp; filmmakers. Browse Themes Business Themes Food Blog Themes Portfolio Themes Video Themes WooCommerce Themes View All 30 Themes &rarr; Inspiro Pricing Plugins Plugins Recipe Card Blocks 15,000+ installs &middot; Beautiful recipe cards for WordPress blogs. Instagram Feeds 70,000+ installs &middot; Display your Instagram feed on your website. Elementor Addons 30,000+ installs &middot; Advanced widgets &amp; templates for Elementor. WPZOOM Forms 20,000+ installs &middot; Powerful contact forms plugin. More Plugins WPZOOM Portfolio 25,000+ installs &middot; Showcase your work professionally. WPZOOM Share Buttons 125,000+ installs &middot; Add social media icons & sharing buttons. Inspiro Patterns NEW AI-powered page sections &amp; patterns for Inspiro theme. View All Plugins &rarr; Customers Blog Support Documentation Support Desk WordPress Services Community Forum Contact Sign in NEW Inspiro Premium now includes 40+ ready-to-use starter sites! Unleash the Power of WordPress: Transform Your Website with Our Unique Themes &amp; Plugins Since 2009, we've been making high-quality WordPress themes and plugins. Ease of use and fast support come as standard. Amaze your audience with extraordinary functionality and style today!"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "The freedom to create the websites you want Browse through our gallery of expertly-crafted premium WordPress themes to find the perfect one for your needs."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Inspiro Premium Business / Portfolio / WooCommerce Foodica PRO Food / Blog / Magazine Reel Video / Portfolio Cookely Food / Blog / Magazine Academica Pro 3.0 Education / Organization Gourmand Food / Blog / Magazine VideoBox Video / Podcast / WooCommerce CookBook Food / Blog / Magazine Inspiro PRO Video / Portfolio / WooCommerce View all themes 6 Reasons to Choose Our Themes With 16 years of experience , we've got features built into every theme we know you're going to love!"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Stunning Responsive Design Our themes look incredible on every device. With responsive design tailored for desktops, tablets, and mobiles, you’ll never worry about how visitors experience your site—it just works."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Quick Installation Install your theme effortlessly in just minutes with our user-friendly process. Comprehensive documentation guides you through setup, so you can launch your site with confidence."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "One-Click Demo Importer Recreate the demo’s layout, design, and content with a single click. Easily import demo widgets, settings, and layouts, then customize everything to align perfectly with your brand."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Clean, SEO-Optimized Code Built with clean, modern web standards, the code is SEO-friendly, readable, and highly adaptable. Crafted by professionals, it's fully optimized for top-tier performance."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Multilingual Support Fully localized and translation-ready, WPZOOM themes simplify the process of building multilingual sites. With step-by-step tutorials, creating a professional global presence is straightforward."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "14-Day Money-Back Guarantee We’re confident you’ll love our WordPress products, which is why we offer a 14-day money-back guarantee. Your purchase is entirely risk-free, giving you complete peace of mind."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Compatible with Your Favorite WordPress Plugins & Page Builders"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "We work with other developers, to make sure that our themes work great with popular plugins and page builders. To ensure ongoing compatibility, we run automated tests with many plugins periodically."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "You Are in Good Company!"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Our Themes & Plugins are Trusted by 200,000 Customers and Companies Worldwide"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "The best service I have ever gotten from developers. Great customer service to top it off."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Lizzy Cascalheira-Thomas"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "We are in the process of starting our food blog (using the Foodica theme). Ina has been fantastic to work with; our e-mails are daily as I attempt to learn all the technical aspects of working with Word Press, widgets, and the theme. She has all of the answers, fixes [&hellip;]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Chris Pogozelski https://www.tasty-lowcarb.com/ Foodica has transformed the way I blog for the better. Paying for a WordPress theme is completely worth it &#8211; especially if you’re not a true techie. It streamlines the process of building a site and saves so much time. Plus, it looks great. All of the compliments I get on my blog started after I installed Foodica"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Hilary Paige Smith Excellent 4.7 out of five star rating on Trustpilot 4.7 out of 5 Trustpilot How it Works? Our themes can be used by anyone of any age! You don't need absolutely any coding skills or a programming background."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "30 Premium Themes Our collection includes popular names like Inspiro , Foodica PRO and many other feature-packed themes which can help you build the website of your dreams!"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "6 Premium Plugins We may be known for our themes, but we are also the creators of top-rated plugins such as Recipe Card Blocks , Instagram Widget , WPZOOM Portfolio & many others!"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "WPZOOM Home About Blog Features How it Works Customers Testimonials Brand Assets OUR PRODUCTS Plugins Themes Food Blog Themes Video Portfolio Themes Business Themes Magazine Themes Video Themes Portfolio Themes WooCommerce Themes Restaurant Themes WordPress Block Themes Resources Support Center WordPress Services WordPress Hosting WP Theme Detector WordPress Statistics F.A.Q. Affiliates Sitemap Terms &amp; Conditions Privacy Policy WPZOOM newsletter Subscribe to our newsletter to get exclusive discounts and new product launches right in your inbox."
